      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "Studies were eligible if they met the inclusion criteria: (a) report on COVID-19 or SARS-CoV-2 infection and (b) report an outbreak investigation or contact tracing study. Exclusion criteria were: (a) review articles; (b) observational studies providing only the proportion of individuals infected; (c) studies that do not indicate the number of contacts or secondary infections; and (d) reports in media sources.",
      "reason": "Eligible topic and study designs (outbreak investigations, contact tracing studies) are specified, but settings and follow-up requirements are not stated as eligibility criteria."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "(d) reports in media sources",
      "reason": "Publication status is partially addressed (media reports excluded; the flow diagram in text_16/figure_3 also shows exclusions for 'Retracted' and 'Not a prepint or published'), but no language or dissemination-year restrictions are reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_16",
      "quote": "Media report 1 Retracted 1 Modeling study 1 No testing for contacts 1 Analysis on partial contacts 1 Not a prepint or published 2 Provides prevalence 22 Duplicate 25 No clear denominator 53",
      "reason": "The flow diagram distinguishes some exclusion reasons (e.g., 'No testing for contacts' vs 'No clear denominator'), but it does not explicitly separate exclusion because outcomes were not measured from exclusion because outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "A pooled analysis was carried out to generate summary estimates for the secondary attack rate in each subgroup analysed (asymptomatic, pre-symptomatic and symptomatic index cases)",
      "reason": "Synthesis groups are specified (asymptomatic, pre-symptomatic, symptomatic index cases) and correspond to the review objective of estimating secondary attack rate by symptom status (text_5)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No rationale is provided for notable eligibility restrictions such as excluding review articles, studies without contact numbers, or media reports."
    }
